   "ruling": "Ruling: scope — i8962 p. 18, Line 28, \"If you are self-employed and are claiming the self-employed health insurance deduction, see Self-Employed Health Insurance Deduction and PTC in Pub. 974 for the amount to enter on line 28.\". A return claiming the self-employed health insurance deduction with the premium tax credit is refused: sc.hi_screen (forms/2025/sc.yaml) asks whether \"the insurance was obtained through the Marketplace and advance payments of the premium tax credit were made or you are claiming the premium tax credit\" and refuses sc.f7206_line1 and the return, so the Pub. 974 line 28 amount cannot arise on a computed return. The restatement is faithful to the project's Table 5 line; the omission the model names is handled by that screen, not by line 28.",
